; z80dasm code/data map for banks 0x0B-0x0D (map window @ 0x6000).
; regen-bank.sh keeps only blocks whose start falls in the 8K being disassembled.
; Block names avoid colliding with in-source labels (z80dasm emits NAME_start).
; Banks 0x0B/0x0C are metatile streams/defs (already labeled data); no code map.

; ===========================================================================
;  bank 13 (0x0D) @ 0xA000
; ===========================================================================
; Graphics / metatile defs occupy most of the bank; only the room-transition
; brain and the white-key door table at the top are code + authored tables.

; Metatile defs (0xA041 used when 0xC41A!=0), Simon sprite pointer tables
; (0xA281 / 0xA2D1), and RLE streams (intro_simon 0xA319, intro_sky 0xB895).
data_gfx: start 0xA000 end 0xB963 type bytedata

; Connectivity code 0xB963-0xB9D2 is left as code (z80dasm default).

; Per-stage word table of pointers into the nibble records below.
data_conn_ptr: start 0xB9D3 end 0xB9F9 type worddata
; Packed connectivity: 2 bytes/room = nibbles up,down,left,right (0xF=blocked).
; Stage 0..18 packed end-to-end; stage 18 ends at 0xBB31.
data_conn_recs: start 0xB9F9 end 0xBB31 type bytedata

; door_load / door_load_coords 0xBB31-0xBB60 left as code.

; White-key door: 19 records of (room | vert<<7), Y, X.
data_door_tbl: start 0xBB61 end 0xBB9A type bytedata

; spot_load_coords 0xBB9A-0xBBCC left as code.

; Stage/room -> (Y,X) spots that arm 0xC5B1 and fill 0xC5B2/C5B4.
data_spot_tbl: start 0xBBCD end 0xBBF6 type bytedata

; Japanese title sprites at 0xBBF6 (title_jp_sprites), then logo_font
; 0xBE59 (52 x 8x8 1bpp Konami-logo glyphs) + 0xFF pad.
data_tail: start 0xBBF6 end 0xBE59 type bytedata
data_logo_font: start 0xBE59 end 0xC000 type bytedata
